<h1 style="font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#1a202c;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;">⏰ Your Subscription Expires {{daysLabel}}</h1>
<p style="color:#718096;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 24px;">
  Hello <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>, your SentinelFi® <strong>{{plan}}</strong> subscription for <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> is expiring soon.
</p>

<div class="alert-warning">
  <strong>⚠️ Action Required</strong> — Renew before <strong>{{expiryDate}}</strong> to avoid interruption to your workspace.
</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0;padding:24px;background:#fffbeb;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #f6c90e;">
  <div style="font-size:48px;font-weight:900;color:#d97706;">{{daysRemaining}}</div>
  <div style="font-size:14px;color:#92400e;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Days Remaining</div>
</div>

<table class="info-table">
  <tr><td>Company</td><td>{{companyName}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Current Plan</td><td><strong>{{plan}}</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Billing Cycle</td><td>{{billingCycle}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Expiry Date</td><td><strong>{{expiryDate}}</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Renewal Amount</td><td><strong>${{renewalAmountFormatted}} USD</strong></td></tr>
</table>

<p style="color:#4a5568;font-size:14px;">
  After expiry, your workspace will be <strong>suspended</strong> and access for all team members will be blocked.
  Your data is retained for 30 days after expiry to allow for reactivation.
</p>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:28px 0;">
  <a href="{{renewUrl}}" class="button">Renew Subscription Now →</a>
</div>

<p style="color:#a0aec0;font-size:12px;text-align:center;">
  Need to discuss your plan? <a href="mailto:support@sentinelfi.com" style="color:#00A3B5;">Contact our team</a>
</p>
